SY_TALK("Hq14fpkvS8k",[[1,["That, the central one is the sustaining power","means is the power by which we evolve, that"]],[9,["means we get our sustenance as it is."]],[12,["This sustenance that we have got as a human","being when it is to be manifested on the five"]],[19,["elements that we have within ourselves, the","source is there but we have to reach it through"]],[28,["its different elements."]],[29,["When this interchange takes place or, we can","say, when we have to put this force outside,"]],[41,["that is to be done through establishment of","Dharma on these."]],[47,["Like a superimposition or, you can say, the","connection."]],[52,["Like you can say, say there is sun."]],[56,["Sun is the source of light and the source","of light has (to?) come to this earth which"]],[67,["is created out of the five elements."]],[71,["So the sun’s rays have to come, but when","they come inside, in this move, what do they"]],[81,["do?"]],[84,["They enlighten this world."]],[89,["But it’s only possible if there is Dharma,","means the light is there, the rays are there."]],[94,["The rays can be obstructed by many things."]],[97,["If the rays are obstructed, then there is","a-dharma."]],[106,["So the source of Dharma, the spreading of","Dharma and ultimately the manifestation onto"]],[115,["the five elements is a complete thing that","is Void."]],[120,["This play goes on within us."]],[124,["Our evolutionary power which has worked from","the very beginning, from matter state, when"]],[130,["the matter got itself as organized then we","had carbon as tetravalent, then from carbon,"]],[136,["the life started – all this is the work","of the sustaining force."]],[141,["Then we became human beings."]],[144,["Now we have got ten dharmas within us which","we have to keep alright."]],[149,["These are the main ten commandments."]],[152,["These ten commandments we have to look after."]],[156,["And these are looked after by the people who","are the primordial masters, as you call them"]],[165,["“incarnations”…(a noise covers the voice)","like Raja Janaka, like Moses, like Socrates,"]],[176,["like Nanaka, the last one was the Shirdi Sai","Nath."]],[188,["This is the principle is there, is the primordial","master."]],[193,["Now, there is another principle that is in","there by which you receive it."]],[201,["This is called as the disciple principle,","the primordial disciple principle, represented"]],[208,["by the moon and the sun, presided by Buddha","and Mahavira."]],[220,["So, this disciple element if it is not in","you, you cannot receive it."]],[231,["But when you start getting – receiving it,","this Dharma gets into you and then you become"]],[239,["the guru."]],[240,["You become the guru when this is completely","sustained in you."]],[246,["It starts as a disciple and then ends up as","a Guru."]],[252,["First of all, as the human beings are, we","do not observe the first ten basic principles."]],[255,["This is the Void part within us."]],[269,["In this country for example, or in the West,","we have – we observe the five of them because"]],[276,["of laws."]],[281,["In the countries like India, they observe","the rest five, because of their society."]],[290,["So in any way we are lacking some of them."]],[295,["Five are missing here or five are missing","there."]],[299,["This is the situation of the Dharma today."]],[303,["The Gurus and their disciples they do this","connection and then the matter, which is created"]],[317,["out of five elements, get vibrated."]],[325,["You can enlighten the matter."]],[329,["When the Dharma is complete you can enlighten","the matter."]],[334,["The rituals that these people used which was","called as you see, do Dharmik rituals, they"]],[344,["call them do dharmik, these are the deeds","of Dharma, is to worship, to do Puja and to"]],[351,["pray to God and to do all these things, prayer."]],[358,["All these things after some time became absolutely","deadened because there was no realized soul"]],[368,["as a Guru and no realized soul as a disciple."]],[373,["So it was just a joke going on, you see."]],[376,["It has no meaning."]],[378,["Supposing I tell somebody who is not realized","to give himself a bandhan, he cannot."]],[385,["[Aside: “He is coming back, don’t you","worry!"]],[388,["Both of them have run away."]],[390,["He’ll agree then somehow."]],[393,["The sister is realized, the wife is realized."]],[396,["Born."]],[397,["But the husband is like that, what to do?"]],[403,["Yogi: He came."]],[404,["Shri Mataji: Eh?"]],[406,["He came in."]],[407,["(Yogis: “Came”.)"]],[408,["Came, ran away half-way, he still cannot decide","which way to go."]],[412,["(A yogi says something)"]],[416,["Shri Mataji: He is alright."]],[418,["Should be alright."]],[419,["Yogi: I’m wondering where he’s gone."]],[422,["Shri Mataji: I beg your pardon?"]],[424,["Yogi: I would like to know whether he’ll","come."]],[427,["(Indistinct words)"]],[429,["Shri Mataji (laughs): So you will see gradually","how it works.]"]],[432,["So this Void is so important because that","is how you establish your receiving ends in"]],[445,["your being, the five elements within you."]],[450,["Meaning the five elements that exist (within","you?"]],[457,["In Sahaja Yoga, we try the other way round","stuff."]],[460,["Yes, I have tried it this (way?)."]],[463,["Now, what to do?"]],[464,["The Dharma is all ruined."]],[467,["It is."]],[470,["There is another way: all these elements are","represented in your chakras, different chakras."]],[482,["So why not take the Kundalini through these","chakras and enlighten the elements themselves?"]],[488,["Even there is no Dharma in a person you can","do it."]],[492,["But then the Kundalini goes back to all the","places which you have missed."]],[501,["But if you have been to some guru and you","have bent your head before him, then the Kundalini"]],[509,["stops at that Void."]],[510,["It doesn’t move, it goes here, and there,","and there."]],[513,["It just stops, it doesn’t go further, it’s","very difficult."]],[515,["You have seen the Void pulsating so badly."]],[519,["It just doesn’t rise, it always goes back","into that bottomless pit as you can call it."]],[525,["It’s always sucked into that again and again","if you have had a guru."]],[529,["So we try to remove the guru from your mind","by so many ways."]],[536,["Deny them completely, absolutely, so that","they get out of your minds."]],[543,["And again raise the Kundalini, and from the","innermost, the Brahma Nadi as they call it,"]],[551,["the innermost Nadi, the Sukshma Nadi."]],[554,["Otherwise, you cannot reach there."]],[557,["From outside you go on cleansing, cleansing,","cleansing until you reach there, you find"]],[560,["you cannot pierce through."]],[562,["But outside cleaning helps you in one way,","that the Brahma Nadi becomes wider, the Nadi"]],[571,["that is in the center of Sushumna."]],[574,["If you – there’s less pressure then it","is a wider one so for Kundalini rising there"]],[579,["is a better chance."]],[583,["But in Sahaja Yoga, the subtlest of subtlest","Kundalini we catch, and thread it microscopically"]],[594,["inside, and take it out."]],[598,["And by taking it out what happens, these chakras","definitely get enlightened, they expand."]],[605,["That’s how we expand the Sushumna."]],[608,["Expanding Brahmanadi."]],[611,["This was – this is the trick of Sahaja Yoga."]],[615,["Because this cleansing is going to take too","much time as you said."]],[619,["The whole thing is to be cleansed out and","then it is to be released and then you have"]],[625,["to meet some guru who has to take it."]],[630,["So the Sadhachar [virtue, correct action],","whatever Buddha has said, the right, the right"]],[638,["action, the right that he has said it, is","the one that is Dharma."]],[645,["That’s what is described."]],[648,["But that doesn’t work out with human beings,","it’s meant for people who are realized souls."]],[653,["Most of these religions are meant for realized","souls, you can find out."]],[661,["Actually realized souls only took to religion","before."]],[666,["Those who were born again, Dwijah, Brahmins,","who took to religion."]],[674,["But the time has come for people who are not","realized also to take to religion and to receive"]],[682,["His blessings."]],[684,["Sahaja Yoga is the only way one can do it","– is to take it in the subtle-most – innermost"]],[694,["Nadi, enlightened every chakra, increase the","size of the chakra, pierce a little bit here,"]],[704,["then again raise the another thread, then","again the third thread, like that, go on expanding."]],[710,["[Aside: “This is it, you are alright."]],[713,["This is how it works out."]],[715,["In her case I did the same, I was just talking","to you."]],[721,["Now the main thing about Void one has to remember:","there is no rationality."]],[729,["It’s the hunger inside the stomach, and","hunger has no rationality: if it is hungry"]],[739,["it will eat."]],[741,["It has to eat, no rationality can satisfy","it: if you are hungry you are a bhakta (seeker)."]],[749,["And when you have spiritual hunger, the same","hunger becomes subtler and subtler, ultimately"]],[757,["it becomes a spiritual hunger."]],[760,["First, the hunger starts of, say, food, of","primitive things."]],[767,["Then hunger for sex life, hunger for women,","hunger for men, then for power, then for money."]],[778,["Then the hunger for spirituality starts."]],[782,["When that hunger is concentrated and starts","rising without any rationality about it: you"]],[794,["don’t know why you are seeking."]],[796,["Like Buddha: he had everything, he had a wife","and his father had provided him with everything."]],[805,["Still, his heart was seeking."]],[810,["Why was he seeking?"]],[813,["It’s the hunger that is not rationality,","that isn’t explained."]],[819,["And then this hunger starts and the way we","quench that hunger is Dharma."]],[837,["The way we keep it intact is the Dharma."]],[842,["Supposing you are hungry: you go and eat some","poison: then it is a-dharma."]],[853,["I know you are hungry, but you have to eat","proper food."]],[860,["The knowledge about that is Dharma: what food","you must eat, what books you must read, what"]],[872,["people you must meet, how you should live,","what should be your attitude towards others,"]],[882,["others’ things, others’ wives, children,","daughters."]],[891,["Everything related to the other, all that","knowledge is Dharma."]],[900,["But it has no rationality."]],[905,["Like, you see, a man ran away, say, with somebody’s","daughter, he would say: «What’s wrong?»"]],[914,["I cannot answer it."]],[916,["I cannot answer it."]],[920,["If a man has bad relations, say, with his","own mother."]],[926,["He says: «What’s wrong in this?»."]],[929,["You cannot answer, there’s no rationality."]],[932,["It is so, it’s a fact: «Thou shall not","commit adultery.»"]],[939,["Christ has said even to have adulterous eyes","is wrong."]],[942,["But at the time, it was Christ who came in."]],[946,["At the Moses’ time people did not know this","eyes business, but Christ could see that and"]],[951,["He had said it, that: «Those who have even","adulterous eyes are committing a sin.»"]],[962,["So, how to deal with the others?"]],[967,["Say, materialism now: we are so attached to","matter, is also problem of the Nabhi."]],[975,["Materialism is a false identification with","matter, all falsehood – with matter, with"]],[986,["human beings, with books, with all that is","created, is the problem of Nabhi, so you can"]],[996,["understand how important is Nabhi."]],[1002,["And the one that prescribes it, is the Dharma,","is the Guru."]],[1008,["They did not come like Me to convince you","and argue out with you."]],[1013,["They said: «Thou shalt not…»."]],[1015,["That’s a commandment."]],[1017,["Commandment means there’s not to reason","why."]],[1023,["It’s a commandment."]],[1025,["There’s no rationality in Dharma."]],[1028,["Now, the one who is dharmic does not think","about sin at all."]],[1037,["Now, I’ll tell you about Myself."]],[1039,["Say, I go to a party and they start a cabaret","dance."]],[1043,["I do not think about it whether it is illegal","or whether it is wrong with this adharma,"]],[1047,["nothing."]],[1048,["I do not think, but immediately I vomit."]],[1052,["My grand-children, you see, they one day were","watching the TV and three of them came vomiting."]],[1058,["I went and saw the TV and it was a horrid","thing going on."]],[1061,["They just came and started vomiting."]],[1064,["There’s no rationality about it: it is against","human sustenance."]],[1067,["It is sub-human."]],[1071,["Like animals cannot feel the dirt or filth,","we can."]],[1074,["We feel horrible smell coming."]],[1079,["But those who work, say, in filth cannot feel","any smell."]],[1088,["If you go near a factory where sugar is produced","you feel terrible there, get the smell of"]],[1097,["these molasses and you can’t bear it, but","those who are working there are so much used"]],[1101,["to it that they cannot feel it."]],[1104,["Those who live in sin cannot feel the sin","after some time, they become insensitive to"]],[1107,["it."]],[1110,["But sin is a sin."]],[1113,["So the insensitivity when we develop within","ourselves we become adharmic."]],[1117,["When we are sensitive about it, we are dharmic."]],[1120,["On the left-hand side, the intuition about","it, the auspiciousness of it – is the thing"]],[1130,["that one has to learn, the auspiciousness."]],[1133,["A housewife is to be respected, honoured and","comforted because it is auspicious."]],[1138,["A wife has to be respectable."]],[1141,["A housewife doesn’t – It doesn’t look","nice for a housewife, you see, to be dressed"]],[1148,["in a funny way."]],[1151,["Once a chief cabinet secretary from India,","his wife had come and she used to think she"]],[1157,["is very young and smart or something."]],[1160,["She was wearing those tight jeans and things","like that, you see."]],[1164,["And the poor husband, you see, looked at this","side, that side."]],[1167,["He didn’t know what to do."]],[1169,["And she is – I mean, very big man."]],[1171,["Alright."]],[1173,["And she came down in London, she was thinking:","«Oh, she is a great, smart thing», you know."]],[1178,["And they were invited to a dinner – it’s","a real thing, you know, real thing that has"]],[1182,["happened."]],[1183,["And when this man was to go from somewhere","and she had to go from somewhere else."]],[1187,["So, when he went there, he said: «Where is","my wife?»"]],[1189,["Said: «She hasn’t come right now.»"]],[1192,["He said: «No, she was to come, she is not","like that, she is much smarter than me, she"]],[1195,["must have arrived.»"]],[1196,["He looked around, he couldn’t find her."]],[1199,["And there was a lady standing, he said: «There’s","your secretary has come, she is standing there.»"]],[1205,["And he didn’t know what to say because she","really looked like a secretary and not his"]],[1210,["wife."]],[1214,["So the housewife has to be dignified and respectable","and she is to be respected."]],[1222,["It’s the part of that auspiciousness."]],[1227,["And the wife, that essence of a wife is the","governing…"]],[1235,["So you can imagine those women who used to","stand for lib and all that and those who tried"]],[1244,["to sort of say that: «Why should we be respectable","if the husband is not if he is carrying on"]],[1249,["with the other women I should also carry on","with the other men.»"]],[1254,["You must know that you are withholding that","great position in the stomach, on the left-hand"]],[1261,["side of every human being."]],[1264,["And that’s why the left Nabhi catches in","England so much; and in America, I think it’s"]],[1268,["missing already (laughter)."]],[1278,["So, that is to ask to, say, to a man you see,","who is so developed, and is so, he thinks"]],[1285,["no ends of himself, you see, and the civilization","where work is so important and money is even"]],[1292,["more important than work is."]],[1295,["To him, it’s silly to think that a housewife’s","respectability is so important in the play"]],[1301,["of the universe."]],[1302,["Yes, it is."]],[1304,["Where the women become dis-respectable the","whole – you see, that’s the breaking point"]],[1309,["of the society."]],[1311,["There the human beings will start destroying."]],[1314,["That’s the real atomic bomb you have got."]],[1320,["But it is so, I cannot rationalize it, it","is made like that."]],[1331,["All the Gurus have said: «You should not","drink.»"]],[1333,["Even Moses."]],[1337,["Every one of them has said: «You cannot drink»,","means take any kind of ann alcohol or any"]],[1347,["things that will take away your awareness,","because that is the place of your awareness."]],[1351,["In the sense that whatever goes wrong here","spoils your attention, and if your attention"]],[1358,["is spoiled, your awareness is spoiled."]],[1361,["The attention is in here."]],[1366,["The attention is in the stomach, in the Void."]],[1369,["So, how important is your attention."]],[1372,["Wherever you put your attention, that works","out."]],[1375,["When you are realized, then your attention","is realized."]],[1380,["Wherever you put your attention it works like","a spade, it works like a sword, it works like"]],[1391,["a loving hand, it works like a kiss, it works","like a comforting heart."]],[1401,["It is an enlightened attention in your stomach."]],[1405,["You see, the mother has the child in the stomach,","in the womb, and how it looks after the child,"]],[1412,["a little baby, how it protects."]],[1415,["All that is there is given to us through our","Gurus, our own beings which are our masters,"]],[1430,["who teach us."]],[1433,["The stomach teaches you, your stomach is your","Guru."]],[1436,["Amoeba became a human being through the stomach","only, through the hunger it had."]],[1446,["If it did not have hunger it would not have","evolved."]],[1450,["And the hunger teaches you."]],[1452,["And when you learn it properly, then you become","the Guru yourself of the whole world and the"]],[1458,["universe."]],[1467,["Void, that’s why is very important, and","when you have had bad gurus, you have read"]],[1474,["horrible books, accepted them as facts and","truths, then your Void gets spoiled, your"]],[1482,["attention gets spoiled."]],[1487,["It goes to wrong things."]],[1491,["Attention, when it works through your eyes,","can also go to wrong things."]],[1501,["Everywhere wherever the attention moves it","can do wrong things if it is adharmic."]],[1507,["But as I said there is no rationality about","it."]],[1512,["Dharma is to be accepted."]],[1515,["You cannot rationalize it."]],[1518,["To a point, you may try, but how far it harms","you, you cannot rationalize."]],[1530,["And then the curses of Divine comes on you."]],[1539,["Any kind of fanaticism or identification with","one ideal – like Muslims thinking they are"]],[1549,["Muslims."]],[1551,["They are adharmic."]],[1553,["They are not dharmic."]],[1556,["Dharma is that you have to respect all the","religions."]],[1563,["It is a sin not to respect any incarnation."]],[1568,["It is a sin not to respect any religion."]],[1578,["And to identify with one and denounce the","other."]],[1586,["So, give up all these false dharmas and come","to that one Dharma which evolves you, which"]],[1594,["gives you light by which you can see the oneness","among all these religions."]],[1605,["As I’ve said it before, that they are like","beautiful flowers on one tree nurtured by"]],[1613,["one sap, adorned by one tree; but fools take","the flowers out, say that “These are our"]],[1621,["flowers” and kill them."]],[1625,["And when these flowers die, ugliness becomes","the so-called religions."]],[1635,["So, in essences, respect all the religions,","and all the incarnations."]],[1639,["Fanaticism is absolutely against the Nabhi","and against the Void because the whole balance"]],[1652,["of your Void is to be kept."]],[1654,["In a very subtle and subtler form, you will","be sticking onto it."]],[1660,["Say, you are born a Christian, so whatever","you may try you cannot get out of this feeling"]],[1665,["that “We are Christians”."]],[1666,["You’ll have much more respect for Mary in","heart than for, say, Lakshmi."]],[1673,["While you are a Hindu, you will have much","more respect for Radha than for Mary."]],[1684,["That will be lingering on and lingering on."]],[1689,["When you develop that balance alright, then","you are dharmic."]],[1697,["That balancing has to be done."]],[1704,["So one realization is within you like this."]],[1711,["And one realization is this way, among you,","and this is Dharma."]],[1720,["Among all of you, there has to be another","integration, a complete integration of understanding."]],[1729,["Whether you are white, black or red, whether","a Hindu, Christian or anything, you must know"]],[1738,["that there is only one way that is the living","way of evolution and that there is only one"]],[1746,["God."]],[1747,["And all of them are aspects of the same God,","and there is no quarreling among them."]],[1756,["Why are you quarreling?"]],[1758,["This goes against the Void."]],[1763,["Complete integration works out in the stomach."]],[1768,["And when you are completely integrated, you’ll","be surprised, rationality drops out."]],[1778,["Automatically it drops out."]],[1782,["Rationality keeps disintegration because if","your heart says something, rationality says:"]],[1787,["«No, it’s not right.»."]],[1790,["But, if you take out your rationality there","and just see for yourself, then wisdom comes"]],[1801,["in and you just do it whatever is wise and","good for your spirituality."]],[1819,["[Aside: “How are you now?"]],[1821,["It’s better, it’s working out”.]"]],[1825,["So, Void we use in Sahaja Yoga in many ways."]],[1829,["First of all, we have to, first of all, see","the Void of a person, how he has got the Void."]],[1836,["You can see it very easily because it might","be pulsating."]],[1840,["Maybe not be in your presence, I don’t know,","but in My presence it does."]],[1845,["But immediately you can feel the Void."]],[1847,["The Void you feel on here, or on here."]],[1851,["Now, just see these are the bases of all the","chakras."]],[1856,["You feel the Void here, or here."]],[1859,["Basis of all the chakras you can feel, so","you can understand how important is Void."]],[1865,["Now, if it is catching here anywhere, or catching","over here, you see, then you have to ask the"]],[1871,["questions about these various points: whether","he is a materialist, whether he is a fanatic."]],[1884,["But these questions you cannot ask that directly,","because if I say: «Are you a fanatic?»,"]],[1887,["he’ll hit Me hard."]],[1890,["[Laughter]"]],[1893,["You have to be very, very clever about it."]],[1897,["Now, how to ask a person whether you are a","fanatic or not?"]],[1902,["Very easy."]],[1905,["Say, he","is a Muslim."]],[1907,["So, you just ask him to put your hand, saying","that: «Should I put some Kumkum on your head?»"]],[1915,["So his fanaticism will come out immediately:","«I can’t do this!»"]],[1922,["If he is a Christian then you just ask him:","«Can you put a Swastika on your hand?»"]],[1931,["Cross he’ll accept."]],[1933,["Swastika: «No, I’m not Hitler!»"]],[1937,["(Laughter)"]],[1938,["That’s how you can make it out whether he","is open-minded or not, by suggesting things"]],[1944,["like this."]],[1945,["So then he comes out with his fanaticism."]],[1947,["Then what do you do?"]],[1949,["You do not condemn him as fanatic, no."]],[1952,["That won’t be Sahaja style."]],[1954,["You say: «Alright, alright I’ve got it."]],[1957,["The cross, will that be alright?"]],[1959,["Alright, take the cross."]],[1961,["Now, if I say that cross was first Swastika","then it became cross, will you be angry?»"]],[1965,["Gradually it will work out."]],[1969,["But if he is a fanatic you go outside and","tell Mohammad Sahib to beat him nicely."]],[1976,["So He’ll do the job."]],[1978,["Shoebeating is very necessary for all the","fanatics."]],[1982,["Nice shoebeating."]],[1985,["But fanatics are one of the most difficult."]],[1991,["Then those who have been to other gurus also","will be showing up."]],[1994,["These days you don’t get fanatics so many","who’d come to Sahaja Yoga."]],[1998,["Mostly they are guru-bitten (Shri Mataji laughs)."]],[2004,["You see, there are frostbitten people, there","are guru-bitten also (She laughs)."]],[2008,["I mean, you see, mostly they are guru-bitten."]],[2012,["Then you ask them: «Have you been to a guru?"]],[2013,["What your guru has done?"]],[2015,["This, that.»"]],[2016,["If you tell them sometimes they can be fanatically","attached to their gurus."]],[2020,["Then they might be angry."]],[2021,["They do it, but what to do?"]],[2023,["You see sometimes you have to tell them."]],[2025,["[A ring bells – apart:"]],[2026,["Shri Mataji: It’s the food?"]],[2027,["Yogi: Yes."]],[2028,["Yogi: Yes, Shri Mataji."]],[2030,["Shri Mataji: It’s good they are looking","after the food very nicely."]],[2035,["(Laughter) Otherwise, if you have to cook","also, then all your attention is there."]],[2038,["So, much better than your ashram."]],[2041,["(Laughter)"]],[2043,["Yogi: Agreed!"]],[2044,["Shri Mataji: No headache, nothing, you are","having a nice time here and their food is"]],[2047,["ready, now serve, come along, have your food."]],[2051,["Much better than your ashram."]],[2053,["So, the right time, we are talking about Void."]],[2056,["(Laughter) Alright."]],[2059,["I’ll sit here –"]],[2068,["(Yogi speaks: “All our hunger has been satisfied","today.\""]],[2073,["Shri Mataji laughs)"]],[2075,["Shri Mataji: Yes, make the food also dharmic","and then eat it."]],[2078,["Good."]],[2079,["How are you now?"]],[2080,["Better?"]],[2081,["Yogini: Yes!"]],[2082,["Shri Mataji: Yes!"]],[2084,["This will do good to many because so many","have had this problem with guru business."]],[2088,["How are you now?"]],[2089,["It’s good…]"]],[2090,["[Tape interruption]"]],[2091,["It’s such a wide subject that I cannot cover","it in one lecture, you’ll require many more;"]],[2095,["but the most important thing about Void is","that that once you are enlightened, you become"]],[2104,["dharmic yourself."]],[2105,["The Dharma starts flowing through your hand."]],[2110,["These vibrations have a capacity to establish","Dharma."]],[2117,["So, when you put your hands now towards the","five elements, say you put your hands towards"]],[2122,["the water, or you put your hand in the water","– the water gets enlighted, vibrated."]],[2129,["Then if somebody takes that water, it will","establish Dharma into that person."]],[2136,["Supposing somebody is a drunkard, now you","put this vibrated water to him, give him to"]],[2142,["drink."]],[2143,["He’ll feel nauseated after drinks."]],[2146,["He’ll throw away the drinks, then he will","stop."]],[2149,["Some of you have noticed that when you came","to Me first you felt a terrible nausea within"]],[2154,["you and you felt like vomiting, sometimes","you felt uneasy, you see."]],[2159,["So these vibrations through the water now","pass into your stomach and they establish"]],[2167,["Dharma there, the proper relationship."]],[2170,["It so happens that if you go on taking this","water, the right-side is that physically you"]],[2178,["feel alright, and the water can give you such","a power that you will never get cancer of"]],[2184,["the stomach, never get any trouble with the","stomach."]],[2189,["But left-side side it has greater power, this","water, that it cleanses you – your sins"]],[2196,["– and puts your attention, fixes it up on","Dharma."]],[2202,["So, your attention doesn’t do – you are","not tempted, that’s how you have seen people"]],[2208,["who come to Sahaja Yoga can give up drinks","easily."]],[2212,["Because it turns your attention towards Dharma."]],[2216,["Then if you want to take drinks you just don’t","feel like after some time."]],[2220,["You feel like vomiting, you feel like headache,","and all that."]],[2224,["And it happens so easily."]],[2226,["Now we know somebody’s reaction – he gave","up with all his drinking in no time."]],[2230,["Otherwise, it’s not possible to do it, but","because of this happening in the stomach,"]],[2235,["now you cannot drink."]],[2239,["Just imagine."]],[2240,["This is the great thing about Void is that","once you are enlightened you can give something"]],[2250,["to the nature."]],[2252,["You have been drawing everything from nature","so far."]],[2256,["First time now you start giving something","to the nature."]],[2259,["And what you give to the nature is so nourishing","to it also."]],[2263,["Supposing you give vibrations to, say, fruits,","or to trees, or to flowers."]],[2271,["You will find they will be ten times more,","the growth will be much more, they will be"]],[2275,["lustrous."]],[2276,["And they will be very juicy, very tasty and","the whole atmosphere will be different."]],[2282,["Maybe after some time these trees, if they","will be standing there, anybody will be passing"]],[2288,["that way, if he touches the tree they will","get the vibrations also from there."]],[2293,["So maybe a tree may become a curer, something","like that."]],[2297,["All those waters and all that, we talk of","«curing water», are nothing but vibrated"]],[2302,["waters."]],[2303,["They are vibrated."]],[2305,["So, if the vibrated water goes inside, you","get cured."]],[2309,["So, this is on the left-hand side it works,","that it establishes your religion within you."]],[2317,["All the problems you have had is all completely","cleansed out by that."]],[2324,["In the same way, if you enlighten a light","– now here [Mother turns to the flame of"]],[2328,["the candle] you have seen so many times just","here, what you can enlighten a light is."]],[2331,["So it starts going, see, both are there but","this one is working as if…"]],[2335,["It’s actually also going vertically, but","this and this you have taking out the black."]],[2342,["It is because it is enlightened."]],[2343,["That is also enlightened, no?"]],[2345,["So it may also take out."]],[2347,["But this one actually in the hand is taking","away the…"]],[2350,["If you see these lights you can feel they","are like pulled out like this."]],[2355,["As if, you see, the realized lights are pulled","out like this, straight."]],[2359,["And, I’ve been to some of these churches","where they have these lights, and as soon"]],[2368,["as I enter inside they all go “kakakakakak”."]],[2371,["(Shri Mataji laughs)"]],[2372,["It is interesting to see how they start suddenly","glowing like that."]],[2376,["But people do not notice it because they do","not understand how, why it has happened, but"]],[2380,["you can understand that."]],[2383,["So, if you put the light, enlightened light","–"]],[2385,["Say, yesterday – the other day we had that","Havana, is the enlightened light."]],[2390,["Havana we had made it enlightened, Jagrut."]],[2395,["Then whatever we put into it, you see, our","badhas and everything, it burned whatever"]],[2401,["we wanted to burn away."]],[2402,["What is the beauty of fire is that, say, if","you have some mixed-up gold and you put it"]],[2411,["to fire, you will find the gold will be separated","and the filth or dirt or whatever is inside"]],[2417,["it will be separated."]],[2419,["So, this quality, which is the right-hand","side quality of the fire is, becomes in the"]],[2424,["left-hand side is that when you go near such","a fire, or you use such a fire or a light,"]],[2432,["then what happens that whatever is unwanted","in you is burned away, and you get the pure"]],[2441,["thing."]],[2442,["So it purifies."]],[2445,["Fire is a purifier and it is a melter, it","melts your heart."]],[2450,["This fire melts your heart and you feel the","compassion."]],[2454,["So that’s how every element can be enlightened,","and this is the work done in the Void by your"]],[2461,["Kundalini."]],[2462,["Kundalini goes to various places and She enlightens","all these elements in your stomach."]],[2470,["In the stomach, the basic principle is of","water."]],[2475,["The Void is covered with water, and in the","water there is salt, and the salt is nothing"]],[2482,["but is the Dharma."]],[2484,["Is the Dharma, the salt."]],[2487,["That’s why when we give you salt what happens","– the salt that is vibrated goes and helps"]],[2494,["you in the stomach."]],[2496,["And salt shows its own nature there by absorbing","all that is in you which is, we can say, is"]],[2507,["mobile there."]],[2508,["A person supposing is, has got a cancer problem,","then he should take salt."]],[2515,["If he has a right-hand side problem, he should,","she should just take sugar."]],[2519,["So these are the two qualities, you see, the","five of dharmas are done by salt and five"]],[2526,["by sugar."]],[2527,["And these are the best solvents in the water,","as you know."]],[2531,["So, all these three things put together: water,","then salt, then the sugar, they solve the"]],[2539,["problem of the Void."]],[2541,["That’s why we use these two things."]],[2544,["If you remember Christ has said that “you","are the salt”."]],[2547,["That means you are the Gurus."]],[2553,["Salt is the Guru."]],[2555,["That’s why he said: «You are the salt.»"]],[2558,["Because you are the Gurus."]],[2560,["And salt dissolves into water."]],[2563,["Water is the Dharma."]],[2566,["They are the absorbers – (a noise covers","some words… probably “salt”) always"]],[2570,["has a water of crystallization."]],[2572,["They, it cannot exist without, the salt cannot","exist without water."]],[2577,["So, the water and salt put together means","ocean."]],[2581,["So Void is the ocean within us."]],[2583,["That’s why it is called as Sagara."]],[2586,["That means all the oceans of the world are","in our stomach."]],[2590,["And if you want to hear them sometimes, you","can put your thumb in my ears and you can"]],[2595,["hear it coming (as a sound?"]],[2599,["Indistinct), you can hear it."]],[2601,["So this is all the time this ocean is churned","and out of it comes out all that is good,"]],[2610,["and whatever is bad is burnt away, or washed","away, or made to – with the air – it is"]],[2618,["So the air element is also there, air element","that we see all around."]],[2618,["made to be swept off."]],[2633,["[Recording cut] … so the vibrated air is","a very important thing and it helps a lot."]],[2641,["[Recording cut]"]],[2642,["So I’ve talked to you about all the four,","but the fifth one is Akasha, it’s the ether,"]],[2649,["you can say."]],[2656,["That works out when you are a realized soul."]],[2661,["Then you, you also vibrate the Ether."]],[2666,["That’s how our main collective work is done,","through the Ether, you see."]],[2672,["Now, supposing I want that you should get","a proper seat – “Whether you are going"]],[2679,["or something, alright, take a seat, alright”","– anything materialistic you can say, or"]],[2684,["My chair how do you down there, how will this…"]],[2687,["I have to just worry about it, immediately","[Shri Mataji snaps Her fingers] the orders"]],[2692,["are sent, alright?"]],[2693,["So, Saint Michael and Saint Gabriel, both","of them say: «Now what should we do?"]],[2700,["We must find a proper place.»"]],[2702,["So, they take Don into consideration,"]],[2705,["then they bring him down here and find out a nice","place for him."]],[2709,["Is all done through Ether."]],[2711,["Ether, it becomes – when it is enlightened,","you see, then it communicates the ideas, the"]],[2718,["things which are Divine or the desires, the","Divine desires are carried out."]],[2723,["And then you are placed into his hands, sometimes","you are surprised: «How am I here?"]],[2727,["How are you here?"]],[2728,["How do I meet you?"]],[2730,["I mean, I was not to come this side and then","now how did I come?»"]],[2733,["All these things can be done through the Ether","which…"]],[2736,["Even we get our television and everything","through Ether."]],[2741,["But on the television, if the Ether, if you,","if you, say, enlighten it, then it will so"]],[2752,["happen, that a bad [spread?] program won’t","materialize."]],[2756,["It won’t materialize."]],[2759,["It can work very dynamically."]],[2762,["You cannot imagine how these miracles take","place."]],[2765,["And real miracles are felt, you know of course","we do feel the miracles of all the other elements,"]],[2771,["but it’s not so obvious as that of the Ether","because you are suddenly surprised: «How"]],[2775,["this?"]],[2776,["Why?»"]],[2778,["And it’s – everybody is surprised at it,","all here in in the plate you get all this."]],[2783,["So, this is done by Ether and it is so miraculous."]],[2788,["It is so miraculous, that it is hard to believe","that it is possible."]],[2794,["Now, this Ether works day-time and night-time."]],[2799,["It doesn’t take rest anywhere."]],[2802,["It’s all the time up for us, means it is","all the time ready to work out the divine"]],[2807,["work."]],[2808,["All the time it is ready to work out the divine","work."]],[2811,["It doesn’t wait."]],[2812,["It doesn’t wait for anyone to give orders","or anything; it’s just, just waiting there."]],[2819,["As soon as it sees that this is desired, alright,","nothing is to be told, just to desire and"]],[2825,["you say that: «Oh, what will be happening","to such and such person?»"]],[2829,["Finished, it’s done."]],[2830,["It has been transmitted."]],[2833,["The same Ether that transmits the – what","you call?"]],[2840,["– the air transmissions which you receive","on the radios, radio transmissions."]],[2846,["The same one, when enlightened, does all this","job."]],[2852,["He works it out, everything."]],[2854,["Everything that you want it works it out."]],[2857,["And there’s how the angels show their…"]],[2861,["[Shri Mataji searches the word in Marathi]","their miraculous feats."]],[2868,["But it is worth noticing all that and watching","it, and witnessing it and noting it down:"]],[2875,["«Oh, how it helped and how it worked out!»"]],[2878,["And it also Ether when enlightened brings","people closer to Divine power."]],[2885,["It arranges and organizes."]],[2889,["But now, one would ask what is the necessity","for God to have such complicated methods of"]],[2897,["“enlightening the matter”?"]],[2901,["Why not it has already the enlightened matter?"]],[2906,["It’s the question one should ask, I mean,","I’m asking as you people are there, so I’m"]],[2912,["asking you."]],[2913,["Let’s see the answer."]],[2915,["That’s your problem."]],[2917,["Yesterday I told you to say that “I’m","not guilty”."]],[2922,["It’s just a joke you are enjoying, you are","just playing games with yourself when you"]],[2931,["say that."]],[2932,["Because you like to play such terrible jokes","with yourself."]],[2938,["Don’t say that you are guilty."]],[2940,["At all."]],[2941,["By saying that, you see, you are trying to","enjoy a sort of a sadism against yourself."]],[2948,["You are against yourself."]],[2951,["Self that is your Spirit."]],[2957,["The yogi: That’s what it feels like, it","feels like…"]],[2961,["(Indistinct words)"]],[2962,["Shri Mataji: That’s not a good thing."]],[2965,["That’s not what is wanted, is not what is","desired, so just don’t play on them."]],[2972,["Whatever are your moods are not correct."]],[2976,["They should not be there."]],[2982,["By your moods, you are lost."]],[2986,["Sometimes you get this mood, sometimes you","get another mood of aggression."]],[2993,["Whether is a temper or something like that."]],[2997,["And sometimes you get into this kind of an","apologetic mood."]],[2999,["Both are useless, absolutely useless."]],[3001,["Just throw them away."]],[3005,["Why should we do it?"]],[3022,["Both are mythical."]],[3031,["– (The yogi speaks) – Yes, this positivity","also – this so-called positivity means aggression"]],[3035,["on others, you start showing your aggression","on others."]],[3039,["You can aggress others also."]],[3043,["That’s even worse."]],[3049,["– (The yogi speaks) – That’s, that’s,","that’s, that’s the thing I was saying."]],[3053,["Be joyous, be happy for what God has given","you."]],[3059,["Watch the birds in the morning time."]],[3064,["See the flowers in the morning time."]],[3071,["What do they have?"]],[3074,["They are standing in the sun, in the rain,","they are facing the nature all the time."]],[3083,["Imagine the delicate petals of the flowers."]],[3091,["Do they show any signs of negativity or of","aggression?"]],[3100,["They only emit fragrance."]],[3103,["Till they live they will emit fragrance."]],[3106,["When they will die, they are not bothered."]],[3114,["Aggressive person cannot come to Sahaja Yoga,","he cannot go very far."]],[3119,["Neither a negative person, but aggressive","cannot."]],[3123,["He’ll drop out."]],[3129,["Sahaja Yoga recedes from such people."]],[3138,["You have to be humble, but you are not to","be slaves."]],[3148,["In extremes at least one should know the difference","between the two."]],[3155,["You see, there is extremes, say something","is very black – then you can see the white"]],[3160,["very clearly against it, isn’t it?"]],[3163,["And when you know how to move from one extreme","to another extremes, you should be able to"]],[3169,["see both the things very clearly."]],[3176,["And that’s how you come to the center."]],[3185,["I mean, it is for your own good to be like","that."]],[3191,["You may say: “Yes, we understand, Mother,","but we can’t do it”."]],[3196,["Could try."]],[3198,["You just watch yourself and see how it works,","how your mind is working: it’s your horse"]],[3208,["and you have to master it."]],[3212,["You are supposed to be a rider and the horse","is taking you somewhere wherever it feels"]],[3218,["like, either to negativity or to the positivity","so-called – means the aggressiveness."]],[3225,["It’s the horse that is leading you, not","you are leading the horse."]],[3235,["What kind of a rider it is?"]],[3241,["And the horse is like a pendulum and you are","led by it."]],[3252,["And when you identify yourself with that horse","you think: “What to do?"]],[3259,["It is happening.\""]],[3260,["You can control it."]],[3272,["You have to tell yourself, that is to tell","your mind to behave itself."]],[3281,["Otherwise, you people cannot go very deep","into Sahaja Yoga."]],[3288,["You have to go much deeper."]],[3291,["If you are worried about superficialities","you cannot go deeper."]],[3301,["Deep down is the Truth."]],[3304,["There lies all the joy."]],[3310,["All the trees, all the big trees have their","roots deep down."]],[3319,["Find out your roots: where are they?"]],[3324,["They are all embedded in your heart and in","your Spirit, not in these superficial things"]],[3339,["where your mind is moving with the wind, here","and there, just like a dead leaf."]],[3351,["If a big train arrives, and the train is faced,","say – with a – some sort of an obstacle,"]],[3363,["it cannot stop."]],[3365,["But if there’s a little worm and if it wants","to save itself from the train it can."]],[3373,["It can hide itself away somewhere."]],[3379,["You are not a worm."]],[3380,["You are a human being."]],[3383,["A little living thing can do that much."]],[3388,["You are a human being and if you cannot stop","yourself from your destruction,"]],[3399,["then who can stop you?"]],[3405,["You see the nature: people live together."]],[3410,["Tiger lives in a forest and there are many","creatures who exist, too."]],[3421,["But if human beings cannot save themselves","with all the brain that they have, their dynamic"]],[3428,["styles you see, with all the energy that they","have, with all the discoveries that they have"]],[3433,["made, then who is going to save mankind?"]],[3444,["Either you aggress on others or you kill yourself:","and then what should Mataji do?"]],[3451,["Or what should anyone do under these circumstances","– but to make you face it?"]],[3467,["In Sahaja Yoga, you can face it very clearly."]],[3472,["You can see others doing it also, but first,","you must see it in yourself."]],[3477,["Unless and until you see it in yourself what","you are doing to yourself, you cannot see"]],[3481,["in others."]],[3488,["When I say “you see it in yourself” you","become self-centered."]],[3492,["I mean, anything You say can be twisted."]],[3495,["When I say “you see it in yourself”, that","means you detach yourself and see in yourself:"]],[3500,["what is your mind doing?"]],[3502,["That’s how you can love others also that","they are doing the same."]],[3508,["Like a person, say, is fond of good food all","the time."]],[3515,["If he can see that he is hankering after good","food all the time, he is thinking about good"]],[3520,["food, his mind is working like that – if","he can see that he can correct it also."]],[3524,["If he can see it."]],[3526,["Apart from that, when he sees somebody doing","it, he would not hate that person, but he"]],[3535,["would help him to cure."]],[3539,["On the contrary, I have seen those who are","like that, hate the other person, make fun"]],[3545,["of the other person, while they have the same","weakness."]],[3551,["Why, why it happens?"]],[3553,["There’s a, there’s a psychological reason."]],[3558,["Because that point which is doing like this,","wrong in him – you hate that point in you,"]],[3566,["subconsciously, and that’s what you hate","in others; but that is consciously."]],[3573,["If you hate that part in you consciously,","there wouldn’t be any problem."]],[3582,["That part which is negative, the part that","is telling you all these things, the part"]],[3587,["that misleads you, the part that spoils you,","the part that covers the Self – you see"]],[3593,["– in you, if you could manage to see that","and say: “No, not that part, no.\""]],[3604,["But then you start despising the rule (unclear","word)."]],[3609,["It’s a very subtle thing: either you move","from this side to that side."]],[3613,["If I try to push you, you’ll just go like","a spring to the other end."]],[3617,["If I try to push on that side like a spring","you go to the other end."]],[3620,["Thing is, the basic thing is the extremes","are to be avoided."]],[3624,["This is the basic point is: extremes to be","avoided."]],[3634,["If you feel you are getting negative, take","your shoe and beat yourself nicely."]],[3639,["Go out and shout or take a pillow and hit","it hard, alright?"]],[3652,["But if you are negative inside, what you will","do you will go and beat your wife or beat"]],[3655,["your husband, whatever may be the case."]],[3667,["It’s a very simple thing for a Sahaja Yogi","to do, is to be amused about yourself."]],[3675,["Just be amused: “Look at this Mr."]],[3677,["So and So, now it’s me.\""]],[3680,["When you start seeing yourself like that,","you see, be amused at yourself."]],[3686,["“Ah, so now, Mr."]],[3687,["So and So is coming up like this!"]],[3690,["Oh, come along, come along, now the vanity,","come along!"]],[3694,["I would like to see the vanity that I am."]],[3698,["See Mr."]],[3699,["Ego coming up."]],[3701,["Now, here Mr."]],[3702,["Ego stands.\""]],[3703,["(Laughter)"]],[3704,["Then (Shri Mataji laughs) you will start seeing."]],[3707,["Be amused about it in the real sense, and","you will be surprised that these things will"]],[3711,["drop out."]],[3717,["Yogi (not clearly audible): You know this,","I mean when You observe something, and You"]],[3721,["say what You observed…."]],[3723,["(rest is indistinct)."]],[3724,["Shri Mataji: Yes, yes, of course, very much","so."]],[3726,["Yes."]],[3727,["Yogi: You’ll say that…"]],[3728,["Shri Mataji: Yes."]],[3729,["Yogi: But we – but we’ll still not correct","it."]],[3730,["What’s wrong?"]],[3731,["Shri Mataji: No, you should say: “Get away,","you take two running jumps and go away”."]],[3744,["That will help Me."]],[3748,["If you want to have phraseologies, I can tell","you, but I think you are much more equipped"]],[3755,["in English language with all the beautiful","humour that have – you have."]],[3762,["Just play that on yourself, you see."]],[3764,["Humour is a beautiful thing that you can really","play on yourself, instead of playing these"]],[3771,["melancholy songs (laughter) and foolishly","indulging into all this romantic nonsense."]],[3778,["(Laughter)"]],[3780,["Better play some humour on yourself, sit down,","(with a deep sense of humour?"]],[3784,["– Not clear) and enjoy the humour upon yourself."]],[3793,["It works wonders, you see."]],[3801,["And those who know how to laugh at themselves","are the best people."]],[3807,["[Tape cut]"]],[3809,["All that was foolish is chiselled out and","you see the beautiful joy-giving Spirit manifesting"]],[3818,["itself beautifully within you alone."]],[3822,["And all your worries, all your problems and","all negativity and so-called aggressiveness"]],[3827,["and everything just disappears and you are","one with that."]],[3831,["And you are seeing through (all?) that, the","brilliance that it is giving."]],[3837,["You are seeing through and feeling the dignity","of that and the joy of it, the brilliance"]],[3841,["it is giving."]],[3842,["Just think, if you are the sun and you come."]],[3845,["And you see the sun coming, the rays coming","and working it out and curing and changing"]],[3851,["the colours and giving life."]],[3853,["Imagine, how dignified you feel and how beautiful","you feel."]],[3859,["But you don’t feel vain about it."]],[3862,["If you are that you just don’t feel that","there’s something special about it."]],[3866,["You just see it."]],[3870,["Vanity comes when you don’t have something."]],[3873,["When you have it, you say: “It’s alright,","it’s me”."]],[3876,["It’s just flowing."]],[3877,["It’s just watching how it’s beautifully","it is flowing."]],[3884,["Because of scientific research in the psychological","sphere, this myth has come to us that if we"]],[3892,["try to enjoy something like that then you’ll","become proud."]],[3896,["So you just don’t enjoy."]],[3898,["I mean the subtotal of the whole thing is","– psychologists – is this that you don’t"]],[3901,["enjoy anything in life."]],[3903,["It’s the subtotal it comes to (She laughs)."]],[3908,["If it is not worked with a Realized soul,","with the compassion and love and proper understanding,"]],[3918,["it amounts to that."]],[3920,["That you just don’t enjoy anything in life."]],[3924,["You analyze everything: this way you are bad,","that way you are bad."]],[3928,["This way you are wrong, that way you are wrong."]],[3930,["So you are wrong completely, you should be","finished: you are good for nothing, useless,"]],[3934,["thrown away."]],[3935,["End up in the lunatic asylums or in some other","wretched place, which is not meant for human"]],[3947,["habitation at all."]],[3956,["Idiotic it is, I must say."]],[3958,["Stupid it is!"]],[3964,["It is like a – we call it in Marathi Dhoopatne,","is the thing we use for burning the incense,"]],[3974,["you see."]],[3975,["It is hollow on this side and hollow on the","other side also because one side is the stand"]],[3980,["and the another side is where you put the","incense."]],[3985,["So you take that Dhoopatna, and you ask for","something, you see."]],[3989,["So something is given on this cup, you turn","it round for the other side."]],[3993,["So, the other side you can see it, but see","this side that is filled in it’s gone, so"]],[3999,["you go to see, you want to see the other side","now, that what is left in the other one, it’s"]],[4002,["nothing is left altogether, it’s finished."]],[4009,["So it is said that: ‘Hati Dhoopatne dene’","means this dhupatne is the thing is given"]],[4015,["to you in the hand."]],[4016,["So first you see this side, you try to fill","the joy in the cup, alright?"]],[4021,["Then you turn it around to fill the other","side of it."]],[4028,["But this side you receive it and the other","side is the support."]],[4041,["So you need not go to the right, then to the","left."]],[4045,["By the time you go to the left, the right","is over, and the right side you run up to,"]],[4049,["the left is over."]],[4052,["Just be in the center!"]],[4061,["Push yourself in the center."]],[4064,["Just be there."]],[4076,["See the silence."]],[4080,["Silence of joy crawls in."]],[4082,["[Long silence]"]],[4090,["What’s it?"]],[4091,["What happens?"]],[4093,["[A yogi was asleep, exchanges on that, “Sleeping!”","people laugh]"]],[4100,["That’s the best!"]],[4103,["(A yogini says: “Still sleeping beautifully!”.)"]],[4104,["Eh?"]],[4119,["(More laughter and exchanges) That is the","best, this… (indistinct words)."]],[4130,["Now, any questions?"]],[4134,["Yogi: How far should we be concerned with","other people, Shri Mataji…"]],[4137,["Shri Mataji: What’s it?"]],[4139,["Yogi: (Not clearly audible) How far… should","we be concerned with other people, I mean,"]],[4144,["in a situation where are other people there","who should now better understand…"]],[4150,["Shri Mataji: Yes."]],[4151,["Yogi: … (Unclear audio) And yet you know,","you are dependent for them on the stupid ones."]],[4155,["(Shri Mataji laughs."]],[4157,["The yogi continues speaking but it is not","clearly audible)"]],[4165,["Shri Mataji: Yes."]],[4167,["I would say, you see, Regis, that you have","wisdom."]],[4173,["All of you have your wisdom."]],[4177,["And you tell them in a way that you carry","the [boat?] as they say."]],[4184,["Because if you tell somebody: “You are stupid.\""]],[4189,["I mean, he will make hell for Me."]],[4194,["You’d better not do that (She laughs)."]],[4198,["Alright."]],[4200,["Now, if you tell somebody that: “You are","very clever” when he is stupid (laughter)"]],[4205,["if he is really…"]],[4206,["Yogi (not clearly audible): When they think,","they know that, and then it’s not a stupid."]],[4211,["Shri Mataji: Yes, they will know that, too."]],[4214,["Because people here are very clever, you see."]],[4217,["They are stupid in their wisdom."]],[4220,["But understanding that – what others are","talking and all that, they know very well."]],[4228,["So, best thing is whenever you have to work","on them, work on them secretly."]],[4235,["Give them a bandhan, give them shoe-beating."]],[4240,["But openly you give them tea."]],[4243,["[Laughter."]],[4244,["Yogi speaks…"]],[4245,["Vibrated…]"]],[4247,["Vibrated, of course, of course, of course,","of course."]],[4252,["Keep Mataji’s photograph and a candle there","and then invite."]],[4258,["Give them tea."]],[4259,["Give them some chanas."]],[4262,["You see, that’s how you have to work with","these people."]],[4266,["Because they don’t understand this, they","may be clever."]],[4271,["So, give them some Chanas."]],[4274,["When they want to have some water, give them","vibrated water."]]]);
